# the SMK-37 Elite's pads and 1.4's amounts: a pad is a hand, so its effect is full, whatever a CC last said of it,
# and PERFORM's flash shows no bar for it. The CC's amount is back when the pad is up
wait 500
expect view 0
# PERFORM (SCALE is the FM-1's SEL), so the flash is up for what is held
tap SCALE
wait 300
# Reverb (key 14, CC 104) by a CC at 80: under full, and its band has the bar
midi B0 68 50
wait 300
expect pcc 16384
expect amt14 80
expect pbar 1
# pad 8 is Reverb: down, and it is full, with no bar
pad 8 down
wait 300
expect padfx 16384
expect amt14 127
expect pbar 0
# up: the CC still holds it, at its own amount
pad 8 up
wait 300
expect padfx 0
expect pcc 16384
expect amt14 80
expect pbar 1
midi B0 68 00
wait 200
expect pcc 0
expect pbar 0
